    "blurb": "A standing stone that was never carved into anything. It has no face, and it has never taken a step. The fight is the region's thesis: *you are not going to move it, you are going to outlast it.* Reads as endurance through HP and resists, not through soft ATK — ⛔ the boss rule is absolute, it must out-stat its own field on every axis, level and resists included, at the post-WG ×2.2.",
